<view class="page"><text class="heading">发布我的穿搭</text><text class="sub">选择 2–5 件本人衣物。公开作品不会显示价格、地区或穿着历史。</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><view class="item-grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="cloth {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleItem"><image src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.selected ? '已选择' : '点击选择'}}</text></view></view><text class="label">搭配场景</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{scenes}}" value="{{sceneIndex}}" bindchange="onSceneChange"><view class="picker">{{scenes[sceneIndex]}} ›</view></picker><text class="label">搭配心得（选填，最多 30 字）</text><textarea maxlength="30" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNoteInput" placeholder="例如：今天想穿得轻松又有精神"/><text class="count">{{note.length}}/30</text><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交审核</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="goBack">返回</button></view>
